  "story": {
    "day": 78,
    "title": "A Fun Day at the Restaurant",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya met her teammate at a great Hindu restaurant before their big game.",
      "Her aunt and parent sat near a singer who played a loud trumpet.",
      "The restaurant served iced tea, and ninety percent of guests tried the recipe.",
      "They saw ten, eleven, twelve, thirteen, or fourteen children playing outside.",
      "These children enjoyed soccer, baseball, track and field, and so on.",
      "After that, a friendly dog wagged its tail and left them.",
      "Then, one child used a pen to design a hero with color.",
      "The children had many balls, but this ball was not theirs.",
      "Kaya got a great deal, and said, \"They're ours, not theirs.\"",
      "Finally, she decided to try new sports and enjoy her life."
    ]
  }
